Install **SC Final Adventure - Machines** from [CurseForge](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/final-adventure-machines) into a NeoForge **1.21.1** instance.

This pack is a guided factory-and-adventure loop, not a kitchen-sink tech dump:

- Follow the quest / recipe path. Custom recipes and relics tie bosses to automation.
- Stand up early **Create** logistics, then layer **Easy Mob Farm** and **Create New Age** so boss essence has somewhere to go.
- Magic (Ars Nouveau) and Cataclysm combat sit on the same timeline as the factory. Do not ignore one pillar.

The End is not a vanilla portal hunt. You **craft** your way there — Mechanical Crafting is the gate. [Cataclysm DeDust](/mods/cataclysm-dedust) documents the Cataclysm food addon used alongside the boss loop.
